{"id":51275,"date":"2026-05-15T21:14:29","date_gmt":"2026-05-15T20:14:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-auchan\/"},"modified":"2026-08-20T16:12:16","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T15:12:16","slug":"corrida-auchan","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-auchan\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Auchan 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO CORRIDA AUCHAN 2026 -->\n\n<!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Corrida Auchan 2026<\/span>\n  <\/h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A Corrida Auchan est\u00e1 de regresso a 19 de setembro de 2026, transformando o ic\u00f3nico Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor, em Oeiras, num aut\u00eantico festival desportivo para toda a fam\u00edlia. Com op\u00e7\u00f5es que v\u00e3o desde os r\u00e1pidos <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/10k-distancia\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">10 km<\/a> a uma caminhada descontra\u00edda de 5 km, o tra\u00e7ado convida a manter um ritmo constante, aproveitando as sombras e a frescura do complexo. Al\u00e9m de promover a atividade f\u00edsica, o evento tem uma forte componente solid\u00e1ria, com o valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a reverter para a Funda\u00e7\u00e3o P\u00e3o de A\u00e7\u00facar &#8211; Auchan, apoiando fam\u00edlias, crian\u00e7as e jovens.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">\/ Snapshot<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>19 de setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor, Oeiras (Lisboa)<\/span><\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>10 km (Corrida), 5 km (Caminhada), Corrida Rik&#038;Rok<\/span><\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Misto (Asfalto, Ciclovia, Pista de Corta-Mato e Terra Batida)<\/span><\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Prova &#038; Percurso<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O percurso em circuito (com duas voltas para os 10 km) apresenta uma altimetria rolante e bastante acess\u00edvel, ideal para quem procura manter a tra\u00e7\u00e3o e a velocidade sem grandes varia\u00e7\u00f5es de inclina\u00e7\u00e3o. Os participantes v\u00e3o enfrentar uma superf\u00edcie mista: o piso firme das estradas e da ciclovia contrasta com a textura mais solta da pista de corta-mato e dos caminhos que ladeiam o lago de canoagem. Esta varia\u00e7\u00e3o exige alguma aten\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 ader\u00eancia do cal\u00e7ado nas zonas de terra batida, mas permite uma progress\u00e3o fluida. A caminhada de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/iniciar-corrida\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">5 km<\/a> garante um piso est\u00e1vel e protegido pelo arvoredo do complexo desportivo.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 4. BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE (CTA INTERATIVO FIXO) -->\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important; color: #C4B5FD !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; padding: 10px 20px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 5. ONDE FICAR \/ ALOJAMENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar em Oeiras\/Lisboa (Alojamento)<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Para facilitar a desloca\u00e7\u00e3o no dia da prova, recomendamos estas zonas:<\/p>\n  <ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Zona de Alg\u00e9s \/ Cruz Quebrada:<\/strong> Pela proximidade imediata ao Jamor, permitindo um r\u00e1pido acesso ao recinto e minimizando preocupa\u00e7\u00f5es com estacionamento e tr\u00e2nsito no final da tarde.<\/li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Carcavelos \/ Parede:<\/strong> Uma excelente op\u00e7\u00e3o para quem deseja combinar a prova com uns dias perto da praia e da linha de Cascais, contando com f\u00e1ceis liga\u00e7\u00f5es rodovi\u00e1rias ao evento.<\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA E SOBRE O LOCAL -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O Centro Desportivo Nacional do Jamor \u00e9 um aut\u00eantico pulm\u00e3o verde \u00e0s portas de Lisboa, famoso por acolher anualmente a final da Ta\u00e7a de Portugal em futebol. Ap\u00f3s cruzar a meta, sugerimos uma curta desloca\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 Alg\u00e9s ou Bel\u00e9m para recuperar as energias com os ic\u00f3nicos past\u00e9is de Bel\u00e9m e desfrutar de um bom peixe grelhado nas tradicionais tasquinhas da zona ribeirinha.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 7. SEC\u00c7\u00c3O DE FAQS (DESIGN SYSTEM HOMEPAGE) -->\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a Corrida Auchan 2026.<\/p>\n\n  <div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\"><p>Os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o, que pode ser acedida na sec\u00e7\u00e3o de links abaixo.<\/p><\/div>\n    <\/details>\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\"><p>As fotografias do evento s\u00e3o geralmente publicadas nas redes sociais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o ou em plataformas especializadas de fotografia desportiva nos dias seguintes \u00e0 prova.<\/p><\/div>\n    <\/details>\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios das partidas?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\"><p>A Corrida Rik&#038;Rok (crian\u00e7as) tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 16:00, seguida da Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 17:00 e, finalmente, a prova de 10 km arranca \u00e0s 18:00.<\/p><\/div>\n    <\/details>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL -->\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51276,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51275","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-jamor-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/339811576_548682140743839_3966170627577447958_n.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51275","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51275"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51275\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":60836,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51275\/revisions\/60836"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/51276"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=51275"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=51275"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=51275"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=51275"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=51275"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=51275"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=51275"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}